    <task id="Id_fb177bd8-af0c-497e-a8ac-fac0e5093c36" name="Definir Contexto">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;PASSO 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O passo inicial para se estabelecer o contexto &amp;eacute; analisar o ambiente interno e o ambiente externo &amp;nbsp;em &amp;nbsp;que &amp;nbsp;est&amp;aacute; &amp;nbsp;inserida a organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o que &amp;nbsp;esteja &amp;nbsp;sendo avaliada quanto aos riscos existentes, ou mesmo um projeto espec&amp;iacute;fico. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Para &amp;nbsp;analisar &amp;nbsp;diretamente &amp;nbsp;os &amp;nbsp;fatores &amp;nbsp;internos &amp;nbsp;e &amp;nbsp;externos &amp;nbsp;que &amp;nbsp;impactam &amp;nbsp;na organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou na &amp;nbsp;execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;de determinado projeto, faz-se necess&amp;aacute;rio relacionar esses fatores. A ferramenta mais indicada para relacionar esses fatores &amp;eacute; a Matriz SWOT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Devemos ter uma Matriz SWOT geral, ou seja, para a organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o toda, e podemos criar uma matriz espec&amp;iacute;fica para cada projeto, tendo sempre como base a matriz da organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, ou seja, especializ&amp;aacute;-la para cada projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Pontos Fortes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O que voc&amp;ecirc; faz bem? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Que recursos especiais voc&amp;ecirc; possui e pode aproveitar?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Pontos Fracos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;No que voc&amp;ecirc; pode melhorar?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Onde voc&amp;ecirc; tem menos recursos que os outros?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O que os outros acham que s&amp;atilde;o suas fraquezas?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Oportunidades&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Quais s&amp;atilde;o as oportunidades externas que voc&amp;ecirc; pode identificar?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Que tend&amp;ecirc;ncias e &amp;quot;modas&amp;quot; voc&amp;ecirc; pode aproveitar em seu favor?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Amea&amp;ccedil;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Que amea&amp;ccedil;as (leis, regulamentos, outros) podem lhe prejudicar? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Passo 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;DENTIFICAR AS PATES INTERESSADAS E PARTES ENVOLVIDAS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Passo 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Compreender &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;forma &amp;nbsp;geral &amp;nbsp;como &amp;nbsp;determinado &amp;nbsp;processo &amp;nbsp;ou &amp;nbsp;atividade &amp;nbsp;&amp;eacute; realizado &amp;nbsp;para, posteriormente, levantar os ativos &amp;nbsp;envolvidos &amp;nbsp;para &amp;nbsp; identificar &amp;nbsp;poss&amp;iacute;veis problemas que podem ocorrer durante a sua realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o. Esses poss&amp;iacute;veis problemas ser&amp;atilde;o classificados como poss&amp;iacute;veis eventos de riscos. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Passo 4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;FAZER O LEVANTAMENTO DE ATIVOS . Para cada ativo identificado, fazer um descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do mesmo, relatando como ele pode interferir ser uma fonte de riscos. Os ativos podem ser classificados como:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- Pessoas;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- Processos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- Patrim&amp;ocirc;nio;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- Tecnologia;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- Outros.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
