    </task>
    <task id="Id_602bb177-a003-4925-8df2-c4e69d2d2645" name="Identificar Riscos">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_StartFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A identifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do risco de TIC compreende o reconhecimento e descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos riscos de TIC relacionados a um objeto de gest&amp;atilde;o, envolvendo a identifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de poss&amp;iacute;veis fontes de riscos, eventos, causas e consequ&amp;ecirc;ncias.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_EndFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#222222;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Uma lista abrangente de todos riscos identificados deve ser criada, incluindo para cada risco, as fontes e eventos de risco que possam ter algum impacto na consecu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos objetivos e resultados identificados na etapa de estabelecimento do contexto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Pode-se consultar a Base Hist&amp;oacute;rica de Riscos para indentificar os riscos do objeto em discuss&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;T&amp;eacute;cnicas que podem ser usadas:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- Brainstorming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- Diagrama de Causa Efeito&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;-&amp;nbsp;An&amp;aacute;lise &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;Modos &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;Falhas &amp;nbsp;e &amp;nbsp;Efeitos: FMEA (Failure &amp;nbsp;Mode &amp;nbsp;and &amp;nbsp;Effect &amp;nbsp;Analysis)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- Entrevista e Julgamento de Especialistas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
