    <task id="Id_728c3a50-c266-4182-9a3b-c3342b003db5" name="Analisar Riscos">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_StartFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O m&amp;eacute;todo para an&amp;aacute;lise de riscos, se baseia em duas caracter&amp;iacute;sticas dos potenciais problemas: a Probabilidade e o Impacto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1 - A Probabilidade de ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia de determinada situa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de risco &amp;eacute; verificada por meio de uma &amp;nbsp;estimativa &amp;nbsp;da &amp;nbsp;incerteza &amp;nbsp;se &amp;nbsp;concretizar. &amp;nbsp;&amp;Eacute; &amp;nbsp;a &amp;nbsp;probabilidade &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;que &amp;nbsp;o &amp;nbsp;potencial &amp;nbsp;problema &amp;nbsp;ir&amp;aacute; ocorrer. Pode-se &amp;nbsp;partir &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;relat&amp;oacute;rios &amp;nbsp;e &amp;nbsp;registros &amp;nbsp;de ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncias &amp;nbsp;pr&amp;eacute;-existentes &amp;nbsp;e &amp;nbsp;tamb&amp;eacute;m &amp;nbsp;da &amp;nbsp;avalia&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;dos &amp;nbsp;contro (Banco de Dados Hist&amp;oacute;rico). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2 - O Impacto &amp;eacute; a consequ&amp;ecirc;ncia da ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia do risco para o objetivo organizacional ou projeto sendo avaliado e a relev&amp;acirc;ncia ou valor que o ativo possui &amp;nbsp;para &amp;nbsp;a &amp;nbsp;organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Com os riscos identificados, com as respectivas causas e consequ&amp;ecirc;ncias relacionadas, come&amp;ccedil;a a &amp;nbsp;etapa &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;an&amp;aacute;lise &amp;nbsp;dos &amp;nbsp;riscos &amp;nbsp;com &amp;nbsp;base &amp;nbsp;nos &amp;nbsp;crit&amp;eacute;rios &amp;nbsp;pr&amp;eacute;-definidos &amp;nbsp;de probabilidade &amp;nbsp;de ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia, e impacto das consequ&amp;ecirc;ncias, conforme definido na Pol&amp;iacute;tica de Gest&amp;atilde;o de Riscos. O produto final da an&amp;aacute;lise de riscos ser&amp;aacute; a Matriz de Riscos. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A Matriz &amp;nbsp;de Riscos &amp;nbsp;(ou &amp;nbsp;Matriz &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;Probabilidade &amp;nbsp;x &amp;nbsp;Impacto) &amp;eacute; um documento &amp;nbsp;que &amp;nbsp;especifica combina&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;probabilidade &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;um &amp;nbsp;risco &amp;nbsp;e &amp;nbsp;do &amp;nbsp;impacto &amp;nbsp;causado &amp;nbsp;por &amp;nbsp;sua ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia, &amp;nbsp;permitindo &amp;nbsp;assim &amp;nbsp;calcular o n&amp;iacute;vel de risco &amp;nbsp;a &amp;nbsp;partir &amp;nbsp;da &amp;nbsp;multiplica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;dos &amp;nbsp;valores atribu&amp;iacute;dos &amp;agrave; probabilidade e ao impacto. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src="data:image/png;base64," width="761" height="308" alt="" style="border-width:0px;" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
