    <task id="Id_58a12131-dbd5-4985-b2da-e9b3015a5c7f" name="Avaliar Riscos">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Finalizada a an&amp;aacute;lise dos eventos de risco quanto &amp;agrave; probabilidade de ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia e o impacto, &amp;eacute; necess&amp;aacute;rio avaliar os riscos em rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ao seu n&amp;iacute;vel. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Essa etapa faz uso da compreens&amp;atilde;o dos riscos, obtida atrav&amp;eacute;s da an&amp;aacute;lise, para a tomada de decis&amp;otilde;es sobre a prioriza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de futuras a&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es &amp;nbsp;que &amp;nbsp;ser&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;tomadas &amp;nbsp;para eliminar &amp;nbsp;ou &amp;nbsp;reduzir &amp;nbsp;a &amp;nbsp;ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia &amp;nbsp;e &amp;nbsp;o &amp;nbsp;impacto &amp;nbsp;dos &amp;nbsp;riscos identificados. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Segundo a Pol&amp;iacute;tica de Gest&amp;atilde;o de Riscos, as poss&amp;iacute;veis estrat&amp;eacute;gias s&amp;atilde;o:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;"&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td valign="top" width="161" style="width:120.75pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;Estrat&amp;eacute;gia de RESPOSTA AO RISCO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="708" style="width:531pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;DESCRI&amp;Ccedil;&amp;Atilde;O&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td valign="top" width="161" style="width:120.75pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Evitar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="708" style="width:531pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Inclui &amp;nbsp;como &amp;nbsp;consequ&amp;ecirc;ncia a descontinua&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o das &amp;nbsp;atividades &amp;nbsp;que &amp;nbsp;geram &amp;nbsp;os &amp;nbsp;riscos. &amp;nbsp;Evitar riscos pode implicar a descontinua&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de um software, a aliena&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de um equipamento ou a &amp;nbsp;extin&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;uma &amp;nbsp;divis&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;ou &amp;nbsp;processo &amp;nbsp;de trabalho. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td valign="top" width="161" style="width:120.75pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Mitigar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="708" style="width:531pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;S&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;adotadas &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;medidas &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;para reduzir &amp;nbsp;a probabilidade ou o impacto dos riscos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td valign="top" width="161" style="width:120.75pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Compartilhar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="708" style="width:531pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Redu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da probabilidade ou do impacto dos riscos &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;pela transfer&amp;ecirc;ncia &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ou &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;pelo compartilhamento &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;uma por&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;do &amp;nbsp;risco. As &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;t&amp;eacute;cnicas &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;comuns &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;compreendem &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a aquisi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;de produtos &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;seguro &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ou &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a terceiriza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de uma atividade. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td valign="top" width="161" style="width:120.75pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Aceitar &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="708" style="width:531pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Quando &amp;nbsp;o &amp;nbsp;n&amp;iacute;vel &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;risco &amp;nbsp;for &amp;nbsp;baixo &amp;nbsp;ou &amp;nbsp;muito baixo, &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;o risco &amp;nbsp;residual n&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;justifica &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a implementa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;de novos controles &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;para mitig&amp;aacute;-lo, &amp;nbsp;em &amp;nbsp;uma &amp;nbsp;vis&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;custo &amp;nbsp;benef&amp;iacute;cio. Podendo ser aceitos pelo gestor. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td valign="top" width="161" style="width:120.75pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Assumir &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="708" style="width:531pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-top:1pt #000000 solid;border-right:1pt #000000 solid;border-bottom:1pt #000000 solid;border-left:1pt #000000 solid;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Nenhuma &amp;nbsp;medida &amp;nbsp;&amp;eacute; &amp;nbsp;adotada &amp;nbsp;para &amp;nbsp;afetar &amp;nbsp;a probabilidade &amp;nbsp;ou &amp;nbsp;o &amp;nbsp;impacto, &amp;nbsp;visto &amp;nbsp;que &amp;nbsp;o gestor &amp;nbsp;decide &amp;nbsp;assumir em &amp;nbsp;prol &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;outro benef&amp;iacute;cio. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/table&gt;
	&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Ainda Segundo a Pol&amp;iacute;tica de Gest&amp;atilde;o de Riscos, a princ&amp;iacute;pio, a rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o toler&amp;acirc;ncia ao risco x n&amp;iacute;vel do risco, que ir&amp;aacute; definir a estrt&amp;eacute;gia, dever&amp;aacute; seguir a classifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o abaixo: &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Riscos &amp;nbsp;Inaceit&amp;aacute;veis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;: &amp;nbsp;dever&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;ser &amp;nbsp;priorizados &amp;nbsp;quanto &amp;nbsp;ao &amp;nbsp;tratamento, &amp;nbsp;adotando-se &amp;nbsp;as estrat&amp;eacute;gias de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;evitar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt; ou &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;mitigar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;, n&amp;atilde;o havendo necessidade de se analisar o custo-benef&amp;iacute;cio da &amp;nbsp;aplica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;controles, &amp;nbsp;pois &amp;nbsp;as &amp;nbsp;consequ&amp;ecirc;ncias &amp;nbsp;da &amp;nbsp;ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia &amp;nbsp;dos &amp;nbsp;eventos &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;risco suplantam os custos envolvidos no controle; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Riscos Toler&amp;aacute;veis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;: podem ser priorizados quanto ao tratamento, adotando-se as estrat&amp;eacute;gias de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;mitigar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt; &amp;nbsp;ou &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;compartilhar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;, &amp;nbsp;por&amp;eacute;m &amp;nbsp;devem &amp;nbsp;passar &amp;nbsp;por &amp;nbsp;an&amp;aacute;lise &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;custo-benef&amp;iacute;cio &amp;nbsp;quanto &amp;nbsp;&amp;agrave; necessidade de aplica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de controles, tomando como diretriz reduzir os n&amp;iacute;veis de risco ao m&amp;aacute;ximo poss&amp;iacute;vel sem altos custos; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Riscos &amp;nbsp;Aceit&amp;aacute;veis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;: &amp;nbsp;s&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;riscos &amp;nbsp;que &amp;nbsp;a &amp;nbsp;princ&amp;iacute;pio &amp;nbsp;s&amp;atilde;o &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration: underline;"&gt;aceitos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;, &amp;nbsp;n&amp;atilde;o &amp;nbsp;havendo necessidade &amp;nbsp;de &amp;nbsp;tratamento &amp;nbsp;imediato, &amp;nbsp;devendo &amp;nbsp;apenas ser &amp;nbsp;reconhecidos &amp;nbsp;e &amp;nbsp;monitorados quanto &amp;nbsp;&amp;agrave;s &amp;nbsp;ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncias &amp;nbsp;e &amp;nbsp;poss&amp;iacute;veis &amp;nbsp;consequ&amp;ecirc;ncias, &amp;nbsp;sobretudo &amp;nbsp;para &amp;nbsp;se &amp;nbsp;evitar &amp;nbsp;efeitos cumulativos com outros riscos. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src="data:image/png;base64," width="593" height="285" alt="" style="border-width:0px;" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
