    <task id="Id_a6a47a71-e831-45c9-8383-f04f0d27a41a" name="Comunicar Partes Interessadas">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_StartFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Durante todas as etapas ou atividades da aplica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do processo de gest&amp;atilde;o de riscos deve haver comunica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o informativa e consultiva entre a organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e as partes interessadas, internas e externas, para:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Symbol;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;middot; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;auxiliar a estabelecer o contexto apropriadamente e assegurar que as vis&amp;otilde;es e percep&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es das partes interessadas, incluindo necessidades, suposi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, conceitos e preocupa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sejam identificadas, registradas e levadas em considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Symbol;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;middot; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;auxiliar a assegurar que os riscos sejam identificados e analisados adequadamente, reunindo &amp;aacute;reas diferentes de especializa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Symbol;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;middot; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;garantir que todos os envolvidos estejam cientes de seus pap&amp;eacute;is e responsabilidades, e avalizem e apoiem o tratamento dos riscos. Conv&amp;eacute;m que seja desenvolvido um plano de comunica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e realizada consulta interna e externa para apoiar essa atividade, seja por meio de documento formal ou de lista de verifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Segundo a Pol&amp;iacute;tica de Gest&amp;atilde;o de Riscos, uma Matriz RACI deve ser criada, atualizada e divulgada para dar publicidade a esta Gest&amp;atilde;o de Risco.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
